{
 "id": 1233951,
 "titulo": "v430 Update Details (Updated)",
 "fecha": 1533632409744,
 "modificada": 1733057634511,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1233951",
 "html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Greetings, Agents.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">CM_Friday here.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">After much anticipation, Deadpool joins MARVEL Future Fight along with his allies, the X-Force! The question now is, are you all ready for them?</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">In this August update, we have added new characters and improved various existing features to enhance your gameplay experience.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">I hope you enjoy this MARVEL Future Fight update!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">We have added 5 new X-Force Characters and 2 new Uniforms!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">It’s been a long wait, but Deadpool and the X-Force will finally be playable! You can now recruit our lovable Merc with A Mouth through our new Epic Quest, ! You can also unlock Deadpool’s potential and Tier-3, as well as the X-Force’s potential in this update!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">We have added an Alliance feature where you can send items to your Alliance Members!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">We have also improved current features to make your gameplay more convenient, including changes to obtain “Mail” items all at once, Multiple Uru Conversion, and others.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">To find out more information on the update, check out the update details below!</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"line-height: 107%; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span><span style=\"color: #bf8f00;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">Added 5 New Characters!</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: black; font-size: 12pt;\">Deadpool and X-Force arrive in MARVEL Future Fight!</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\">Deadpool, Domino, Psylocke, Fantomex, and Stryfe are now in the game.</span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071454/char.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: red;\">※</span><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;The Skills shown above are the character’s Level 1 Skills.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">※&nbsp; You can obtain Deadpool by playing the Epic&nbsp;Quest: X-Force.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">※&nbsp; You can obtain Domino, and Fantomex by playing the Epic Quest: X-Force, Premium Hero Chest and Get X-Genes daily.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: red;\">※</span><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Psylocke can be obtained by purchasing the Epic Quest: X-Force Deluxe Package.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: red;\">※</span><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Stryfe can be obtained from the Epic Quest: X-Force “<span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">The Clone of Cable</span>”.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣&nbsp; Added 2 New Uniforms!</span></strong></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Cable and Colossus will get new Uniforms!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">These Uniforms are based on the Marvel comics “X-Force”.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">With these new Uniforms, you will see a sturdier Colossus and an even more powerful Cable!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071504/un.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071454/unidis.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: red;\">※</span><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp; The Skills shown above are the characters’ Level 1 Skills.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"line-height: 107%; color: red;\">※</span><span style=\"line-height: 107%; color: red;\">&nbsp; Two new Uniforms will be on sale during the event period after the update. You can check them out on the Marvel Universe menu and by going to the Uniform Room.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #ff6600;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">▣&nbsp; New Epic Quest Added: X-Force</span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">A new Epic Quest has been added! You can follow a character’s story and advance the character at the same time.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Follow the story of Deadpool and his allies by playing the X-Force Epic Quest and make Deadpool stronger along the way!</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071504/epi.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">- Assemble X-Force and track the Death Seed to stop Apocalypse’s resurrection!</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">In the X-Force Special Missions, you can earn Fantomex and Domino’s X-Genes, as well as various advancement materials.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071504/spm.png\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">- Recruit Deadpool’s allies by playing these Special Missions!</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">If you purchase the X-Force: Deluxe package, you can earn extra rewards and play exclusive missions.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071504/del.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">[5/8 7:45 a.m. (UTC+0) / 5/8 12:45 a.m. (PDT) added]<br>\n* Epic Quest Deluxe Package will apply immediately upon purchase and cannot be refuned.<br>\n* The available special stages after using the Epic Quest Deluxe Package can be used continuously.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">- She will be a strong addition to your team!</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">By advancing Deadpool, Domino, Psylocke, Cable, Fantomex, and Colossus to Tier-2, ★6, 6 Mastery, and Level 60, you can unlock Stryfe through the “The Clone of Cable” Epic Quest.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071504/cca.png\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">- You can learn about Stryfe’s connection to Cable by playing the Epic Quest: X-Force!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff6c00; font-family: Verdana;\"><strong>▣&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>Deadpool’s Tier-3 Advancement</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Deadpool’s arrival in MARVEL Future Fight surprised us, but he still has another surprise up his sleeve! In this update, you can unlock his Tier-3 skill!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\">Check out Deadpool’s unique powers!</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://thumbs.gfycat.com/SnivelingCostlyAnteater-max-1mb.gif\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">▣&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>More Characters can achieve their Potential!</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">In our August update, Deadpool, Domino, Psylocke, Fantomex, Stryfe, Cable, and Colossus will have their Potential unlocked.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Unlocking a Character’s Potential will let you level them up to 70!&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Show them the true power of the X-Force by breaking their limits!</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071454/xf.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff6600; font-family: Verdana;\">▣&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #ff6600; font-family: Verdana;\">New Alliance Support feature!</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">You can now share items with your Alliance Members so that you can advance together with your teammates!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">An Alliance Support feature has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071454/sp.png\"></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">You can only ask for Support once and assist other members’ requests three times per day.</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">※&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: red; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;\">The number of times you can ask for Support and help other members will reset once the server resets, which is every 3:00 PM (UTC+0) / 8:00 AM (PDT)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">※&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: red; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -0.25in;\">The Alliance Support function is limited to certain items such as Nornstones, Rank 1 Black Anti-Matter, etc.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #ff6600; font-family: Verdana;\">▣&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Alliance Battle Rotation Changes</strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The Alliance Battle duration has been changed to 14 days from 7 days.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Since the rotation has been changed, the Normal Alliance Battle mode and the Extreme mode participation conditions have been changed as well.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">The rotation changes are the&nbsp;</span><a target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">following</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Malgun Gothic';\">:</span></a></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071454/rol.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #ff0000;\">※&nbsp; Only the entry conditions will be changed to two weeks (14 days).</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #ff0000;\">※&nbsp; The rewards will be distributed once per week as usual.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff6600; font-family: Verdana;\">▣&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #ff6600; font-family: Verdana;\">New Package added in the Mission Shop!</strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">[Store] -&gt; [Mission Shop] “Daily Attendance #2” has been added!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Every day, you will receive additional check-in rewards after your purchase.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Log in consecutively for 28 days and collect every reward to raise a Uniform into&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\">Mythic!</a></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071454/dly2.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/081407/dly2chrt.png\"></span></p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff6600; font-family: Verdana;\">▣&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Other Game Improvements</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The “Claim All” button in the Mail feature has been improved.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071454/clm.png\"></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #3366ff;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #3366ff;\">Save your Energy now and only use it when you really need it!</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Continuous Uru Conversion function has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071454/mur.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">-&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #3366ff;\">The new Uru conversion feature makes it easier to batch convert.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">※ Please take note that in one attempt, batch Uru conversion will be done up to 10 times.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Skill Levels will now be counted in Character Growth Points.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071454/Sklvl.png\"></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #3366ff;\">The higher the Skill Level of your Character, the higher your score will be! Remember to raise your hero rankings!</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana;\">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\">The maximum limit of the following items has been increased to 3,000:</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left: 63.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\">Phoenix Feathers</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left: 63.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\">M’kraan Crystals</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left: 63.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\">M’kraan&nbsp;Shards</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana;\">5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The notification you receive when you have not checked-in to your Alliance in-game yet has been improved.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071454/alch.png\"></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana;\">6.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\">Alliance Battle has been improved so that the game will no longer exit when you score 2 million points while playing Extreme or Challenge modes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 9.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif; color: red; font-size: 12pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; color: red;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; Please take note that the maximum score possible for this mode is 2 million points.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana;\">7.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Warp Device interface has been improved. You can now move from a Mission screen to another Mission screen.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 9.0pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071727/wrp1.png\"></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana;\">8.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If you select a Character that is a Recommended Character for a different Mission besides the one you selected, a prompt will appear to inform you of the change.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/08/071727/wrp2.png\"></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"color: #ff6600; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; text-indent: 0px;\">▣&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #ff6600; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; text-indent: 0px;\">Other Game Improvements</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1. Fixed an issue within the Battle UI where the Shield Icon that appears when a Defensive Buff skill is used occasionally appears only once.</span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2. Fixed an issue where the Enemy Shifters of Special and Story Missions appear in places other than the Boss Stage.</span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3. Fixed a Shadowland issue where in some situations, a player can select duplicate Characters in Team 1 and 2 on the 20<sup style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;\">th</sup><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;\">&nbsp;Floor.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">4. Fixed a World Boss issue where a player can’t select a preset Team Bonus effect for a Character because the “Set Team” button is missing.</span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">5. Fixed an issue where a notification in [Menu] - [Mailbox] does not appear when the reward for Alliance Raid is already available.</span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">6. Fixed an issue in Alliance Raid mode where the game will freeze when a player taps [Menu] then [Check-in] and then tries to enter Alliance Raid again.</span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">7. Fixed a visual issue where the Character ‘Valkyrie’ uses the Skill “Army of Valkyrior” on Alliance Raid: Fenris Stage.</span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">8. Fixed a visual issue where in the Epic Quest: Sorcerer Supreme’s “Dark Advent” Stage, the lava background does not display as intended.</span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">9. Fixed an issue where the Camera view changes when some skills are used.</span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">10. Fixed an issue where the added points of the equipped Card does not display on the Character’s Details menu after previewing a skill of a Character’s uniform.</span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -0.25in; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">11. The text “Only the Alliance Leader can participate in Alliance Conquest” has been&nbsp;</span><a target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">fixed</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Malgun Gothic';\">.</span></a></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">12. An issue where Clear Tickets give more experience than usual when consumed has been fixed.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div>\n<div class=\"msocomtxt\" id=\"_com_1\">\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">We will continue to listen to your feedback and suggestions so that we could further improve and release better content.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Thank you for supporting MARVEL Future Fight!</span></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left: 27.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
}